    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563300/extras/420d3cd680a492b4aa6f6cfe70750b5d.avif?t=1694383256\" /></span><br><br><i>Dream #46 is a contemplative ride game in an idyllic world that could come out of a dream.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563300/extras/e7052d5ad9b86bbb3aaecb4a35bb9e46.poster.avif?t=1694383256\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563300/extras/e7052d5ad9b86bbb3aaecb4a35bb9e46.webm?t=1694383256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563300/extras/e7052d5ad9b86bbb3aaecb4a35bb9e46.mp4?t=1694383256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You control a small sailboat in a tiny world made up of 6 areas where each of them has its own color palette, its inhabitants.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563300/extras/5eb0bdcafa116b6f95df54f4d354ba47.avif?t=1694383256\" /></span><br><br>Navigate wherever you want among what is on offer. The idea is that you have a good time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563300/extras/c81d09a8e6ebbfa678a9c749c112e4a2.poster.avif?t=1694383256\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563300/extras/c81d09a8e6ebbfa678a9c749c112e4a2.webm?t=1694383256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563300/extras/c81d09a8e6ebbfa678a9c749c112e4a2.mp4?t=1694383256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Scrolls are scattered across the dream. Collect one and a positive affirmation will present itself to motivate you...about you.<br><br>Like any dream, this one has an end. To do this, you must collect petals in order to reconstitute flowers and create a bouquet of flowers to finally give it as an offering...<br><br>Have a nice dream.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563300/extras/420d3cd680a492b4aa6f6cfe70750b5d.avif?t=1694383256\" /></span><br><br><i>Dream #46 is a contemplative ride game in an idyllic world that could come out of a dream.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563300/extras/e7052d5ad9b86bbb3aaecb4a35bb9e46.poster.avif?t=1694383256\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563300/extras/e7052d5ad9b86bbb3aaecb4a35bb9e46.webm?t=1694383256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563300/extras/e7052d5ad9b86bbb3aaecb4a35bb9e46.mp4?t=1694383256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You control a small sailboat in a tiny world made up of 6 areas where each of them has its own color palette, its inhabitants.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563300/extras/5eb0bdcafa116b6f95df54f4d354ba47.avif?t=1694383256\" /></span><br><br>Navigate wherever you want among what is on offer. The idea is that you have a good time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563300/extras/c81d09a8e6ebbfa678a9c749c112e4a2.poster.avif?t=1694383256\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563300/extras/c81d09a8e6ebbfa678a9c749c112e4a2.webm?t=1694383256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563300/extras/c81d09a8e6ebbfa678a9c749c112e4a2.mp4?t=1694383256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Scrolls are scattered across the dream. Collect one and a positive affirmation will present itself to motivate you...about you.<br><br>Like any dream, this one has an end. To do this, you must collect petals in order to reconstitute flowers and create a bouquet of flowers to finally give it as an offering...<br><br>Have a nice dream.",
